        {
          "text": {
            "en": "Salt the zucchini sheets lightly and let them drain on paper for 15 minutes, then pat dry.",
            "de": "Die Zucchiniblätter leicht salzen, 15 Minuten abtropfen lassen, dann trocken tupfen."
